    <string name="instructions_show">How to set up the PC</string>
    <string name="instructions_hide">Hide instructions</string>
    <string name="instructions_title">Install Sofabird for Windows on the PC at the TV</string>
    <string name="instructions_step1">On the PC, download Sofabird‑Setup.exe from sofabird.app and run it. It installs for the current user and keeps itself up to date.</string>
    <string name="instructions_step2">In the setup window that opens, allow network access (Windows Firewall): otherwise Windows blocks the phone.</string>
    <string name="instructions_step3">VLC media player 3.0 must be installed on the PC (videolan.org).</string>
    <string name="instructions_step4">Put the phone on the same Wi‑Fi as the PC: the PC appears under “Computers nearby”. Tap it and type the code shown on the TV.</string>
    <string name="instructions_step5">Not in the list? Enter the PC address above: the code window on the PC shows it. The port stays 47555.</string>
    <string name="instructions_step6">No Wi‑Fi? Pair the phone with the PC in the Bluetooth settings and use “Connect via Bluetooth”.</string>

